# Story page: nm-mirror
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Topsy-Turvy
---
The Glass Hall returned, and this time the reflections had opinions.

Every mirror turned {name} around, so that left was right, and up was down, and down was, frankly, rather rude about it.

The giant reflection laughed. 'You still do not know me?' {name} did not. {name} was upside down, and so, out of sympathy, was I.
